      "return_policy": "We offer a 7-day hassle-free replacement warranty for defective or damaged goods on arrival:\n- For Brand New phones: In case of hardware defects out of the box, our verification team provides swift replacement or official warranty claim routing.\n- For Used phones: 30 days checking and hardware testing warranty.\n- Box packed phones must have untampered security seals unless an approved technical defect is documented.",
      "privacy_policy": "Your privacy is sacred. Customer contact numbers and delivery addresses are encrypted and strictly shared only with the designated Pakistani courier partner for dispatch. We never sell customer records.",
