        },
        {
          "question": "What is the difference between PTA and Non-PTA phones?",
          "answer": "Non-PTA phones work on Wi-Fi and have 60 days of temporary cellular SIM functionality upon first use in Pakistan. After 60 days, PTA tax must be paid to continue using local SIM cards. PTA approved devices work permanently on all Pakistani networks with zero tax liability."
        },
        {
          "question": "How can I pay using JazzCash or Easypaisa?",
          "answer": "Select JazzCash or Easypaisa at checkout. Transfer the total to our official till/account number, take a screenshot of the receipt showing the Transaction ID, and upload it directly on the order confirmation screen."
